                "text": "This week marks the 12th anniversary of the signing of the Affordable Care Act (ACA). Despite 100s of attempts to end the ACA in the past 12 years, the ACA has survived & flourished. It continues to provide affordable, quality healthcare for millions of Americans. 1/4",
